    ('july-04', 'july-04-extra-speaking-3', 34, 'Listen & Speak', 'speaking', '{"id":"july-04-extra-speaking-3","format":"speaking","type":"speaking","section":"Listen & Speak","topic":"conversation","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the conversation meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “実は今日は少し疲れています。”.","hintJa":"Actually で本当の情報を加える。","explanation":"Model: “Actually, I’m a little tired today.” (実は今日は少し疲れています。). Connect the complete message naturally; the second attempt checks independent recall.","explanationJa":"お手本は「Actually, I’m a little tired today.」（実は今日は少し疲れています。）です。文全体を自然につなげ、2回目は見ずに思い出して言いましょう。","prompt":"Say the sentence naturally, then try once more without looking.","promptJa":"自然に言ってから、英文を見ずにもう一度話してみましょう。","speakText":"Actually, I’m a little tired today.","speakJa":"実は今日は少し疲れています。"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
