    ('july-04', 'july-04-extra-speaking-5', 36, 'Listen & Speak', 'speaking', '{"id":"july-04-extra-speaking-5","format":"speaking","type":"speaking","section":"Listen & Speak","topic":"possibility","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the possibility meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “あとで雨が降るかもしれません。”.","hintJa":"might は不確かな可能性。","explanation":"Model: “It might rain later.” (あとで雨が降るかもしれません。). Connect the complete message naturally; the second attempt checks independent recall.","explanationJa":"お手本は「It might rain later.」（あとで雨が降るかもしれません。）です。文全体を自然につなげ、2回目は見ずに思い出して言いましょう。","prompt":"Say the sentence naturally, then try once more without looking.","promptJa":"自然に言ってから、英文を見ずにもう一度話してみましょう。","speakText":"It might rain later.","speakJa":"あとで雨が降るかもしれません。"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
