    ('july-05', 'july-05-extra-speaking-1', 28, 'Listen & Speak', 'speaking', '{"id":"july-05-extra-speaking-1","format":"speaking","type":"speaking","section":"Listen & Speak","topic":"decisions","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the decisions meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “少し考えさせてください。”.","hintJa":"即答を避ける丁寧な表現。","explanation":"Model: “Let me think about it.” (少し考えさせてください。). Practise the whole thought as one natural phrase.","explanationJa":"お手本は「Let me think about it.」（少し考えさせてください。）です。意味のまとまりとして自然に言う練習をしましょう。","prompt":"Listen, then say the sentence naturally.","promptJa":"音声を聞いてから、自然に言ってみましょう。","speakText":"Let me think about it.","speakJa":"少し考えさせてください。"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
