    ('july-05', 'july-05-extra-dictation-3', 30, 'Listen & Speak', 'listenType', '{"id":"july-05-extra-dictation-3","format":"listenType","type":"listenType","section":"Listen & Speak","topic":"choices","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the choices meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “考えが変わりました。”.","hintJa":"決定を変えた時。","explanation":"The complete sentence is “I changed my mind.”. Listen for every short grammar word as well as the key expression.","explanationJa":"全文は「I changed my mind.」です。中心表現だけでなく、短い文法語まで聞き取りましょう。","prompt":"Type the complete sentence you hear.","promptJa":"聞こえた英文をそのまま入力してください。","audioText":"I changed my mind.","accepted":["I changed my mind."]}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-05', 'july-05-extra-speaking-3', 31, 'Listen & Speak', 'speaking', '{"id":"july-05-extra-speaking-3","format":"speaking","type":"speaking","section":"Listen & Speak","topic":"reactions","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the reactions meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “なるほど、筋が通っています。”.","hintJa":"説明に納得した時。","explanation":"Model: “That makes sense.” (なるほど、筋が通っています。). Connect the complete message naturally; the second attempt checks independent recall.","explanationJa":"お手本は「That makes sense.」（なるほど、筋が通っています。）です。文全体を自然につなげ、2回目は見ずに思い出して言いましょう。","prompt":"Say the sentence naturally, then try once more without looking.","promptJa":"自然に言ってから、英文を見ずにもう一度話してみましょう。","speakText":"That makes sense.","speakJa":"なるほど、筋が通っています。"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-05', 'july-05-extra-speaking-4', 32, 'Listen & Speak', 'speaking', '{"id":"july-05-extra-speaking-4","format":"speaking","type":"speaking","section":"Listen & Speak","topic":"responses","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the responses meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “まだ分かりません。”.","hintJa":"決まっていない時。","explanation":"Model: “I’m not sure yet.” (まだ分かりません。). Connect the complete message naturally; the second attempt checks independent recall.","explanationJa":"お手本は「I’m not sure yet.」（まだ分かりません。）です。文全体を自然につなげ、2回目は見ずに思い出して言いましょう。","prompt":"Say the sentence naturally, then try once more without looking.","promptJa":"自然に言ってから、英文を見ずにもう一度話してみましょう。","speakText":"I’m not sure yet.","speakJa":"まだ分かりません。"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-05', 'july-05-extra-speaking-5', 33, 'Listen & Speak', 'speaking', '{"id":"july-05-extra-speaking-5","format":"speaking","type":"speaking","section":"Listen & Speak","topic":"choices","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the choices meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “どちらの選択肢でも大丈夫です。”.","hintJa":"either = どちらでも。","explanation":"Model: “Either option works for me.” (どちらの選択肢でも大丈夫です。). Connect the complete message naturally; the second attempt checks independent recall.","explanationJa":"お手本は「Either option works for me.」（どちらの選択肢でも大丈夫です。）です。文全体を自然につなげ、2回目は見ずに思い出して言いましょう。","prompt":"Say the sentence naturally, then try once more without looking.","promptJa":"自然に言ってから、英文を見ずにもう一度話してみましょう。","speakText":"Either option works for me.","speakJa":"どちらの選択肢でも大丈夫です。"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
