    ('june-30', 'june-30-extra-situation', 38, 'Use It', 'situation', '{"id":"june-30-extra-situation","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"Use It","topic":"predictions","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the predictions meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “誰が勝つと思いますか？”.","hintJa":"will で予想。","explanation":"“Who do you think will win?” directly expresses “誰が勝つと思いますか？”. The other choices describe different situations.","explanationJa":"「Who do you think will win?」が「誰が勝つと思いますか？」を直接表します。他の選択肢は別の場面を表しています。","prompt":"Which sentence best expresses this meaning: 誰が勝つと思いますか？","promptJa":"「誰が勝つと思いますか？」に最も合う英文はどれですか？","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"Who do you think will win?","jp":"誰が勝つと思いますか？"},{"id":"b","en":"This exercise is easier than the last one.","jp":"この練習は前のものより簡単です。"},{"id":"c","en":"The second half was exciting.","jp":"後半はわくわくしました。"},{"id":"d","en":"The noise is annoying.","jp":"その音はイライラさせます。"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
