    ('july-13', 'july-13-draft-matching', 10, 'Build It', 'matching', '{"id":"july-13-draft-matching","format":"matching","type":"matching","section":"Build It","topic":"possibility","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the possibility meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “この時間帯に誰かが電話するかもしれません。”.","hintJa":"「この時間帯に誰かが電話するかもしれません。」を表す英文と、possibilityの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Each English phrase has exactly one Japanese meaning. Match the whole message rather than isolated words.","explanationJa":"各英文に対応する日本語は一つです。単語だけではなく、表現全体の意味で組み合わせましょう。","prompt":"Match the English and Japanese.","promptJa":"英語と日本語を組み合わせてください。","pairs":[{"en":"Someone might call me around this time.","jp":"この時間帯に誰かが電話するかもしれません。","cat":"possibility"},{"en":"No one usually calls me at this time.","jp":"この時間には普段誰も電話しません。","cat":"time"},{"en":"My signal is weak.","jp":"電波が弱いです。","cat":"technology"},{"en":"The Wi-Fi connection is unstable.","jp":"Wi-Fi接続が不安定です。","cat":"technology"},{"en":"I need to rush back.","jp":"急いで戻る必要があります。","cat":"movement"},{"en":"That’s unusual.","jp":"それは珍しいですね。","cat":"reactions"}]}'::jsonb, false, 6),
    ('july-13', 'july-13-draft-sorting', 11, 'Build It', 'sorting', '{"id":"july-13-draft-sorting","format":"sorting","type":"sorting","section":"Build It","topic":"time","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the time meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “この時間には普段誰も電話しません。”.","hintJa":"「この時間には普段誰も電話しません。」を表す英文と、timeの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Sort by the purpose of the complete phrase. The available topics are possibility, time, technology.","explanationJa":"英文全体の目的で分類します。今回の分類は「possibility・time・technology」です。","prompt":"Sort the phrases by topic.","promptJa":"表現をトピック別に分類してください。","categories":["possibility","time","technology"],"items":[["Someone might call me around this time.","possibility"],["No one usually calls me at this time.","time"],["My signal is weak.","technology"],["The Wi-Fi connection is unstable.","technology"],["The week went by quickly.","time"],["It feels long at the beginning of the week.","time"]]}'::jsonb, false, 6),
