    ('july-23', 'july-23-draft-mistake', 24, 'Use It', 'mistake', '{"id":"july-23-draft-mistake","format":"mistake","type":"mistake","section":"Use It","topic":"Doraemon","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the Doraemon meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “ドラえもんは猫型ロボットです。”.","hintJa":"「ドラえもんは猫型ロボットです。」を表す英文と、Doraemonの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Correct sentence: “Doraemon is a cat-shaped robot.”. Compare it with the incorrect version and restore the missing or incorrect grammar word.","explanationJa":"正しい英文は「Doraemon is a cat-shaped robot.」です。誤文と比べ、抜けた語や誤った文法部分を直しましょう。","prompt":"Correct the sentence.","promptJa":"英文を自然な形に直してください。","wrongSentence":"Doraemon a cat-shaped robot.","accepted":["Doraemon is a cat-shaped robot."]}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-23', 'july-23-draft-situation', 25, 'Use It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-23-draft-situation","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"Use It","topic":"Doraemon","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the Doraemon meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “どこでもドアならどこへでも行けます。”.","hintJa":"「どこでもドアならどこへでも行けます。」を表す英文と、Doraemonの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"“The Anywhere Door can take you anywhere.” directly expresses “どこでもドアならどこへでも行けます。”. The other choices answer different situations.","explanationJa":"「The Anywhere Door can take you anywhere.」が「どこでもドアならどこへでも行けます。」を直接表します。他の選択肢は別の場面に使う表現です。","prompt":"Which sentence would you use when you want to say: どこでもドアならどこへでも行けます。","promptJa":"「どこでもドアならどこへでも行けます。」と言いたい時、どの英文を使いますか？","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"The Anywhere Door can take you anywhere.","jp":"どこでもドアならどこへでも行けます。"},{"id":"b","en":"I haven’t thought of one yet.","jp":"まだ一つも思いついていません。"},{"id":"c","en":"I’ve just ordered lunch.","jp":"たった今昼食を注文しました。"},{"id":"d","en":"I put it on the floor.","jp":"それを床に置きました。"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-23', 'july-23-draft-visual-1', 26, 'See It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-23-draft-visual-1","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"See It","topic":"health","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Use the visible action and objects as evidence: A person feels mildly ill at home. Choose the sentence that describes that complete scene.","hintJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物を確認し、「少し体調がよくありません。」に合う場面か考えましょう。場面全体を説明する英文を選んでください。","explanation":"The illustration shows this scene: A person feels mildly ill at home. That directly matches “I’m feeling under the weather.” (少し体調がよくありません。); the other choices describe different actions or situations.","explanationJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物が「少し体調がよくありません。」という場面を表しています。そのため「I’m feeling under the weather.」が一致し、他の選択肢は別の動作・場面を表します。","prompt":"Which sentence best matches the illustration?","promptJa":"イラストの場面に最も合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"I’m feeling under the weather.","jp":"少し体調がよくありません。"},{"id":"b","en":"It’s too hot to go outside.","jp":"暑すぎて外に出られません。"},{"id":"c","en":"It fell on the floor.","jp":"それは床に落ちました。"},{"id":"d","en":"I ordered a chicken-and-egg rice bowl.","jp":"親子丼を注文しました。"}],"correct":"a","image":"/assets/questions/visual/july-23-01-under-weather.webp","imageAlt":"A person feels mildly ill at home.","visualAssetId":"july-23-01"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-23', 'july-23-draft-visual-2', 27, 'See It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-23-draft-visual-2","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"See It","topic":"too...to","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Use the visible action and objects as evidence: It is too hot for a person to go outside. Choose the sentence that describes that complete scene.","hintJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物を確認し、「暑すぎて外に出られません。」に合う場面か考えましょう。場面全体を説明する英文を選んでください。","explanation":"The illustration shows this scene: It is too hot for a person to go outside. That directly matches “It’s too hot to go outside.” (暑すぎて外に出られません。); the other choices describe different actions or situations.","explanationJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物が「暑すぎて外に出られません。」という場面を表しています。そのため「It’s too hot to go outside.」が一致し、他の選択肢は別の動作・場面を表します。","prompt":"Which sentence best matches the illustration?","promptJa":"イラストの場面に最も合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"It’s too hot to go outside.","jp":"暑すぎて外に出られません。"},{"id":"b","en":"I’ve just ordered lunch.","jp":"たった今昼食を注文しました。"},{"id":"c","en":"It’s lying on the floor.","jp":"それは床に落ちています。"},{"id":"d","en":"Doraemon is a cat-shaped robot.","jp":"ドラえもんは猫型ロボットです。"}],"correct":"a","image":"/assets/questions/visual/july-23-02-too-hot-outside.webp","imageAlt":"It is too hot for a person to go outside.","visualAssetId":"july-23-02"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-23', 'july-23-draft-visual-3', 28, 'See It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-23-draft-visual-3","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"See It","topic":"movement","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Use the visible action and objects as evidence: A car suddenly appears from a side street. Choose the sentence that describes that complete scene.","hintJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物を確認し、「車が突然現れました。」に合う場面か考えましょう。場面全体を説明する英文を選んでください。","explanation":"The illustration shows this scene: A car suddenly appears from a side street. That directly matches “A car suddenly appeared.” (車が突然現れました。); the other choices describe different actions or situations.","explanationJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物が「車が突然現れました。」という場面を表しています。そのため「A car suddenly appeared.」が一致し、他の選択肢は別の動作・場面を表します。","prompt":"Which sentence best matches the illustration?","promptJa":"イラストの場面に最も合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"A car suddenly appeared.","jp":"車が突然現れました。"},{"id":"b","en":"It fell on the floor.","jp":"それは床に落ちました。"},{"id":"c","en":"I just got home.","jp":"たった今家に着きました。"},{"id":"d","en":"I haven’t thought of one yet.","jp":"まだ一つも思いついていません。"}],"correct":"a","image":"/assets/questions/visual/july-23-03-car-appeared.webp","imageAlt":"A car suddenly appears from a side street.","visualAssetId":"july-23-03"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-23', 'july-23-draft-visual-4', 29, 'See It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-23-draft-visual-4","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"See It","topic":"food","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Use the visible action and objects as evidence: A customer receives a chicken-and-egg rice bowl. Choose the sentence that describes that complete scene.","hintJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物を確認し、「親子丼を注文しました。」に合う場面か考えましょう。場面全体を説明する英文を選んでください。","explanation":"The illustration shows this scene: A customer receives a chicken-and-egg rice bowl. That directly matches “I ordered a chicken-and-egg rice bowl.” (親子丼を注文しました。); the other choices describe different actions or situations.","explanationJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物が「親子丼を注文しました。」という場面を表しています。そのため「I ordered a chicken-and-egg rice bowl.」が一致し、他の選択肢は別の動作・場面を表します。","prompt":"Which sentence best matches the illustration?","promptJa":"イラストの場面に最も合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"I ordered a chicken-and-egg rice bowl.","jp":"親子丼を注文しました。"},{"id":"b","en":"Doraemon is a cat-shaped robot.","jp":"ドラえもんは猫型ロボットです。"},{"id":"c","en":"I’m feeling under the weather.","jp":"少し体調がよくありません。"},{"id":"d","en":"It fell on the floor.","jp":"それは床に落ちました。"}],"correct":"a","image":"/assets/questions/visual/july-23-04-oyakodon-order.webp","imageAlt":"A customer receives a chicken-and-egg rice bowl.","visualAssetId":"july-23-04"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
