    ('july-25', 'july-25-draft-choice-1', 0, 'Understand', 'mcq', '{"id":"july-25-draft-choice-1","format":"mcq","type":"mcq","section":"Understand","topic":"getting","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the getting meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “お腹が空いてきました。”.","hintJa":"「お腹が空いてきました。」を表す英文と、gettingの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"“I’m getting hungry.” is the sentence that means “お腹が空いてきました。”. Check the complete meaning before choosing.","explanationJa":"「I’m getting hungry.」が「お腹が空いてきました。」を表す英文です。単語一つではなく文全体の意味で選びましょう。","prompt":"Choose the English sentence that means: お腹が空いてきました。","promptJa":"「お腹が空いてきました。」に合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"I’m getting hungry.","jp":"お腹が空いてきました。"},{"id":"b","en":"I’m starving.","jp":"もう腹ペコです。"},{"id":"c","en":"He’s getting on my nerves.","jp":"彼にはだんだんイライラしてきました。"},{"id":"d","en":"I have a gut feeling that something is wrong.","jp":"何かがおかしい気がします。"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-25', 'july-25-draft-choice-2', 1, 'Understand', 'mcq', '{"id":"july-25-draft-choice-2","format":"mcq","type":"mcq","section":"Understand","topic":"hunger","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the hunger meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “もう腹ペコです。”.","hintJa":"「もう腹ペコです。」を表す英文と、hungerの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"“I’m starving.” is the sentence that means “もう腹ペコです。”. Check the complete meaning before choosing.","explanationJa":"「I’m starving.」が「もう腹ペコです。」を表す英文です。単語一つではなく文全体の意味で選びましょう。","prompt":"Choose the English sentence that means: もう腹ペコです。","promptJa":"「もう腹ペコです。」に合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"I’m starving.","jp":"もう腹ペコです。"},{"id":"b","en":"I’m annoyed by the noise.","jp":"その音にイライラしています。"},{"id":"c","en":"He’s making me nervous.","jp":"彼のせいで不安になっています。"},{"id":"d","en":"Is anyone there?","jp":"誰かいますか？"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-25', 'july-25-draft-choice-3', 2, 'Understand', 'mcq', '{"id":"july-25-draft-choice-3","format":"mcq","type":"mcq","section":"Understand","topic":"feelings","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the feelings meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “その音にイライラしています。”.","hintJa":"「その音にイライラしています。」を表す英文と、feelingsの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"“I’m annoyed by the noise.” is the sentence that means “その音にイライラしています。”. Check the complete meaning before choosing.","explanationJa":"「I’m annoyed by the noise.」が「その音にイライラしています。」を表す英文です。単語一つではなく文全体の意味で選びましょう。","prompt":"Choose the English sentence that means: その音にイライラしています。","promptJa":"「その音にイライラしています。」に合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"I’m annoyed by the noise.","jp":"その音にイライラしています。"},{"id":"b","en":"I’m frustrated because nothing is working.","jp":"何もうまくいかず、もどかしいです。"},{"id":"c","en":"It’s getting cold.","jp":"寒くなってきました。"},{"id":"d","en":"No one knows the answer.","jp":"誰も答えを知りません。"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-25', 'july-25-draft-choice-4', 3, 'Understand', 'mcq', '{"id":"july-25-draft-choice-4","format":"mcq","type":"mcq","section":"Understand","topic":"feelings","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the feelings meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “何もうまくいかず、もどかしいです。”.","hintJa":"「何もうまくいかず、もどかしいです。」を表す英文と、feelingsの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"“I’m frustrated because nothing is working.” is the sentence that means “何もうまくいかず、もどかしいです。”. Check the complete meaning before choosing.","explanationJa":"「I’m frustrated because nothing is working.」が「何もうまくいかず、もどかしいです。」を表す英文です。単語一つではなく文全体の意味で選びましょう。","prompt":"Choose the English sentence that means: 何もうまくいかず、もどかしいです。","promptJa":"「何もうまくいかず、もどかしいです。」に合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"I’m frustrated because nothing is working.","jp":"何もうまくいかず、もどかしいです。"},{"id":"b","en":"He’s getting on my nerves.","jp":"彼にはだんだんイライラしてきました。"},{"id":"c","en":"Have you ever been hypnotized?","jp":"催眠をかけられたことがありますか？"},{"id":"d","en":"I asked someone to handle my website.","jp":"誰かにウェブサイトを任せました。"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
