    ('july-25', 'july-25-draft-matching', 10, 'Build It', 'matching', '{"id":"july-25-draft-matching","format":"matching","type":"matching","section":"Build It","topic":"getting","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the getting meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “お腹が空いてきました。”.","hintJa":"「お腹が空いてきました。」を表す英文と、gettingの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Each English phrase has exactly one Japanese meaning. Match the whole message rather than isolated words.","explanationJa":"各英文に対応する日本語は一つです。単語だけではなく、表現全体の意味で組み合わせましょう。","prompt":"Match the English and Japanese.","promptJa":"英語と日本語を組み合わせてください。","pairs":[{"en":"I’m getting hungry.","jp":"お腹が空いてきました。","cat":"getting"},{"en":"I’m starving.","jp":"もう腹ペコです。","cat":"hunger"},{"en":"I’m annoyed by the noise.","jp":"その音にイライラしています。","cat":"feelings"},{"en":"I’m frustrated because nothing is working.","jp":"何もうまくいかず、もどかしいです。","cat":"feelings"},{"en":"He’s getting on my nerves.","jp":"彼にはだんだんイライラしてきました。","cat":"nerves"},{"en":"He’s making me nervous.","jp":"彼のせいで不安になっています。","cat":"nervous"}]}'::jsonb, false, 6),
    ('july-25', 'july-25-draft-sorting', 11, 'Build It', 'sorting', '{"id":"july-25-draft-sorting","format":"sorting","type":"sorting","section":"Build It","topic":"hunger","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the hunger meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “もう腹ペコです。”.","hintJa":"「もう腹ペコです。」を表す英文と、hungerの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Sort by the purpose of the complete phrase. The available topics are getting, hunger, feelings.","explanationJa":"英文全体の目的で分類します。今回の分類は「getting・hunger・feelings」です。","prompt":"Sort the phrases by topic.","promptJa":"表現をトピック別に分類してください。","categories":["getting","hunger","feelings"],"items":[["I’m getting hungry.","getting"],["I’m starving.","hunger"],["I’m annoyed by the noise.","feelings"],["I’m frustrated because nothing is working.","feelings"],["It’s getting cold.","getting"]]}'::jsonb, false, 5),
