    ('july-25', 'july-25-draft-dialogue', 23, 'Use It', 'dialogue', '{"id":"july-25-draft-dialogue","format":"dialogue","type":"dialogue","section":"Use It","topic":"anyone","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the anyone meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “誰かいますか？”.","hintJa":"「誰かいますか？」を表す英文と、anyoneの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"“Is anyone there?” answers the previous speaker directly and keeps the conversation coherent.","explanationJa":"「Is anyone there?」は直前の発言に直接答え、会話の流れが自然につながります。","prompt":"Choose the most natural next line.","promptJa":"会話の次の一文を選んでください。","context":"Situation: You hear a sound in the next room. What do you call out?","contextJa":"場面：隣の部屋から音が聞こえました。何と呼びかけますか？","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"Is anyone there?","jp":"誰かいますか？"},{"id":"b","en":"No one knows the answer.","jp":"誰も答えを知りません。"},{"id":"c","en":"I’m starving.","jp":"もう腹ペコです。"},{"id":"d","en":"He’s making me nervous.","jp":"彼のせいで不安になっています。"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
