    ('july-25', 'july-25-draft-visual-4', 29, 'See It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-25-draft-visual-4","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"See It","topic":"nerves","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Use the visible action and objects as evidence: Repeated phone notifications are getting on a person''s nerves. Choose the sentence that describes that complete scene.","hintJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物を確認し、「彼にはだんだんイライラしてきました。」に合う場面か考えましょう。場面全体を説明する英文を選んでください。","explanation":"The illustration shows this scene: Repeated phone notifications are getting on a person''s nerves. That directly matches “He’s getting on my nerves.” (彼にはだんだんイライラしてきました。); the other choices describe different actions or situations.","explanationJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物が「彼にはだんだんイライラしてきました。」という場面を表しています。そのため「He’s getting on my nerves.」が一致し、他の選択肢は別の動作・場面を表します。","prompt":"Which sentence best matches the illustration?","promptJa":"イラストの場面に最も合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"He’s getting on my nerves.","jp":"彼にはだんだんイライラしてきました。"},{"id":"b","en":"I’m starving.","jp":"もう腹ペコです。"},{"id":"c","en":"Have you ever been hypnotized?","jp":"催眠をかけられたことがありますか？"},{"id":"d","en":"No one knows the answer.","jp":"誰も答えを知りません。"}],"correct":"a","image":"/assets/questions/visual/july-25-04-on-my-nerves.webp","imageAlt":"Repeated phone notifications are getting on a person''s nerves.","visualAssetId":"july-25-04"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
