    ('july-26', 'july-26-draft-choice-1', 0, 'Understand', 'mcq', '{"id":"july-26-draft-choice-1","format":"mcq","type":"mcq","section":"Understand","topic":"hope","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the hope meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “来年マレーシアへ行けるといいな。”.","hintJa":"「来年マレーシアへ行けるといいな。」を表す英文と、hopeの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"“I hope I can visit Malaysia next year.” is the sentence that means “来年マレーシアへ行けるといいな。”. Check the complete meaning before choosing.","explanationJa":"「I hope I can visit Malaysia next year.」が「来年マレーシアへ行けるといいな。」を表す英文です。単語一つではなく文全体の意味で選びましょう。","prompt":"Choose the English sentence that means: 来年マレーシアへ行けるといいな。","promptJa":"「来年マレーシアへ行けるといいな。」に合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"I hope I can visit Malaysia next year.","jp":"来年マレーシアへ行けるといいな。"},{"id":"b","en":"I wish I were in Malaysia now.","jp":"今マレーシアにいたらいいのに。"},{"id":"c","en":"I have already eaten breakfast.","jp":"もう朝食を食べました。"},{"id":"d","en":"I had finished dinner before he called.","jp":"彼が電話する前に夕食を終えていました。"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
