    ('july-26', 'july-26-draft-choice-3', 2, 'Understand', 'mcq', '{"id":"july-26-draft-choice-3","format":"mcq","type":"mcq","section":"Understand","topic":"regret","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the regret meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “もっと勉強しておけばよかった。”.","hintJa":"「もっと勉強しておけばよかった。」を表す英文と、regretの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"“I wish I had studied harder.” is the sentence that means “もっと勉強しておけばよかった。”. Check the complete meaning before choosing.","explanationJa":"「I wish I had studied harder.」が「もっと勉強しておけばよかった。」を表す英文です。単語一つではなく文全体の意味で選びましょう。","prompt":"Choose the English sentence that means: もっと勉強しておけばよかった。","promptJa":"「もっと勉強しておけばよかった。」に合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"I wish I had studied harder.","jp":"もっと勉強しておけばよかった。"},{"id":"b","en":"I wish I had been born there.","jp":"そこで生まれていたらよかった。"},{"id":"c","en":"I’ve just arrived home.","jp":"たった今家に着きました。"},{"id":"d","en":"I haven’t taken a bath yet.","jp":"まだお風呂に入っていません。"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
