    ('july-27', 'july-27-draft-situation', 25, 'Use It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-27-draft-situation","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"Use It","topic":"idiom","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the idiom meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “秘密をばらさないで。”.","hintJa":"「秘密をばらさないで。」を表す英文と、idiomの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"“Don’t spill the beans.” directly expresses “秘密をばらさないで。”. The other choices answer different situations.","explanationJa":"「Don’t spill the beans.」が「秘密をばらさないで。」を直接表します。他の選択肢は別の場面に使う表現です。","prompt":"Which sentence would you use when you want to say: 秘密をばらさないで。","promptJa":"「秘密をばらさないで。」と言いたい時、どの英文を使いますか？","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"Don’t spill the beans.","jp":"秘密をばらさないで。"},{"id":"b","en":"I spilled coffee on my shirt.","jp":"シャツにコーヒーをこぼしました。"},{"id":"c","en":"Coffee can be an acquired taste.","jp":"コーヒーは慣れると好きになる味です。"},{"id":"d","en":"I have been to Malaysia.","jp":"マレーシアへ行ったことがあります。"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-27', 'july-27-draft-visual-1', 26, 'See It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-27-draft-visual-1","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"See It","topic":"spill","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Use the visible action and objects as evidence: A person accidentally spills coffee on a white shirt. Choose the sentence that describes that complete scene.","hintJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物を確認し、「シャツにコーヒーをこぼしました。」に合う場面か考えましょう。場面全体を説明する英文を選んでください。","explanation":"The illustration shows this scene: A person accidentally spills coffee on a white shirt. That directly matches “I spilled coffee on my shirt.” (シャツにコーヒーをこぼしました。); the other choices describe different actions or situations.","explanationJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物が「シャツにコーヒーをこぼしました。」という場面を表しています。そのため「I spilled coffee on my shirt.」が一致し、他の選択肢は別の動作・場面を表します。","prompt":"Which sentence best matches the illustration?","promptJa":"イラストの場面に最も合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"I spilled coffee on my shirt.","jp":"シャツにコーヒーをこぼしました。"},{"id":"b","en":"She poured sauce over the pasta.","jp":"彼女はパスタにソースをかけました。"},{"id":"c","en":"This dessert has a sophisticated flavor.","jp":"このデザートは洗練された味です。"},{"id":"d","en":"I had eaten before he arrived.","jp":"彼が着く前に食べていました。"}],"correct":"a","image":"/assets/questions/visual/july-27-01-spilled-coffee.webp","imageAlt":"A person accidentally spills coffee on a white shirt.","visualAssetId":"july-27-01"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-27', 'july-27-draft-visual-2', 27, 'See It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-27-draft-visual-2","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"See It","topic":"pour","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Use the visible action and objects as evidence: A cook deliberately pours sauce over pasta. Choose the sentence that describes that complete scene.","hintJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物を確認し、「彼女はパスタにソースをかけました。」に合う場面か考えましょう。場面全体を説明する英文を選んでください。","explanation":"The illustration shows this scene: A cook deliberately pours sauce over pasta. That directly matches “She poured sauce over the pasta.” (彼女はパスタにソースをかけました。); the other choices describe different actions or situations.","explanationJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物が「彼女はパスタにソースをかけました。」という場面を表しています。そのため「She poured sauce over the pasta.」が一致し、他の選択肢は別の動作・場面を表します。","prompt":"Which sentence best matches the illustration?","promptJa":"イラストの場面に最も合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"She poured sauce over the pasta.","jp":"彼女はパスタにソースをかけました。"},{"id":"b","en":"He splashed water on me.","jp":"彼は私に水をバシャッとかけました。"},{"id":"c","en":"He plays tennis every week.","jp":"彼は毎週テニスをします。"},{"id":"d","en":"I used to live here.","jp":"昔はここに住んでいました。"}],"correct":"a","image":"/assets/questions/visual/july-27-02-poured-sauce.webp","imageAlt":"A cook deliberately pours sauce over pasta.","visualAssetId":"july-27-02"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-27', 'july-27-draft-visual-3', 28, 'See It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-27-draft-visual-3","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"See It","topic":"splash","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Use the visible action and objects as evidence: A child splashes water onto another person. Choose the sentence that describes that complete scene.","hintJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物を確認し、「彼は私に水をバシャッとかけました。」に合う場面か考えましょう。場面全体を説明する英文を選んでください。","explanation":"The illustration shows this scene: A child splashes water onto another person. That directly matches “He splashed water on me.” (彼は私に水をバシャッとかけました。); the other choices describe different actions or situations.","explanationJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物が「彼は私に水をバシャッとかけました。」という場面を表しています。そのため「He splashed water on me.」が一致し、他の選択肢は別の動作・場面を表します。","prompt":"Which sentence best matches the illustration?","promptJa":"イラストの場面に最も合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"He splashed water on me.","jp":"彼は私に水をバシャッとかけました。"},{"id":"b","en":"Coffee can be an acquired taste.","jp":"コーヒーは慣れると好きになる味です。"},{"id":"c","en":"I went to Malaysia last year.","jp":"去年マレーシアに行きました。"},{"id":"d","en":"I wish I had been invited.","jp":"招待されていたらよかった。"}],"correct":"a","image":"/assets/questions/visual/july-27-03-splashed-water.webp","imageAlt":"A child splashes water onto another person.","visualAssetId":"july-27-03"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-27', 'july-27-draft-visual-4', 29, 'See It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-27-draft-visual-4","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"See It","topic":"taste","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Use the visible action and objects as evidence: A person gradually learns to enjoy black coffee. Choose the sentence that describes that complete scene.","hintJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物を確認し、「コーヒーは慣れると好きになる味です。」に合う場面か考えましょう。場面全体を説明する英文を選んでください。","explanation":"The illustration shows this scene: A person gradually learns to enjoy black coffee. That directly matches “Coffee can be an acquired taste.” (コーヒーは慣れると好きになる味です。); the other choices describe different actions or situations.","explanationJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物が「コーヒーは慣れると好きになる味です。」という場面を表しています。そのため「Coffee can be an acquired taste.」が一致し、他の選択肢は別の動作・場面を表します。","prompt":"Which sentence best matches the illustration?","promptJa":"イラストの場面に最も合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"Coffee can be an acquired taste.","jp":"コーヒーは慣れると好きになる味です。"},{"id":"b","en":"This dessert has a sophisticated flavor.","jp":"このデザートは洗練された味です。"},{"id":"c","en":"I have been to Malaysia.","jp":"マレーシアへ行ったことがあります。"},{"id":"d","en":"Don’t spill the beans.","jp":"秘密をばらさないで。"}],"correct":"a","image":"/assets/questions/visual/july-27-04-acquired-taste.webp","imageAlt":"A person gradually learns to enjoy black coffee.","visualAssetId":"july-27-04"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-27', 'july-27-draft-visual-5', 30, 'See It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-27-draft-visual-5","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"See It","topic":"taste","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Use the visible action and objects as evidence: An elegant dessert has a sophisticated flavor. Choose the sentence that describes that complete scene.","hintJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物を確認し、「このデザートは洗練された味です。」に合う場面か考えましょう。場面全体を説明する英文を選んでください。","explanation":"The illustration shows this scene: An elegant dessert has a sophisticated flavor. That directly matches “This dessert has a sophisticated flavor.” (このデザートは洗練された味です。); the other choices describe different actions or situations.","explanationJa":"イラストの人物の動作や物が「このデザートは洗練された味です。」という場面を表しています。そのため「This dessert has a sophisticated flavor.」が一致し、他の選択肢は別の動作・場面を表します。","prompt":"Which sentence best matches the illustration?","promptJa":"イラストの場面に最も合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"This dessert has a sophisticated flavor.","jp":"このデザートは洗練された味です。"},{"id":"b","en":"He plays tennis every week.","jp":"彼は毎週テニスをします。"},{"id":"c","en":"I had eaten before he arrived.","jp":"彼が着く前に食べていました。"},{"id":"d","en":"I spilled coffee on my shirt.","jp":"シャツにコーヒーをこぼしました。"}],"correct":"a","image":"/assets/questions/visual/july-27-05-sophisticated-dessert.webp","imageAlt":"An elegant dessert has a sophisticated flavor.","visualAssetId":"july-27-05"}'::jsonb, false, 1)
) as source (
  lesson_slug, stable_key, position, section, format, payload,
